  "notes": "Dark pro-tool UI (zinc #111113/#18181b) with a single amber accent #f5a524 used for the active mode tab, selected shot, active segment, slider fills and primary CTA buttons (dark text on amber). Icons are emoji throughout (asset tiles, buttons like 🎬, 🎥, ✨) plus unicode glyphs (⇄ ⟳ ⬇ 👁). Viewport is a low-poly previs render with T-shaped numbered floor marks (light blue), red dashed actor paths and white dashed camera paths, character name tags (DEX, MAYA). A floating SHOT PREVIEW mini-viewport sits bottom-right with M/✕ buttons. Mode tabs STAGE/SHOOT/DELIVER restructure the workspace: SHOOT adds shot-type buttons (WS/FS/MS/MCU/CU, OTS, DUTCH…), record/rehearse controls and a bottom track timeline. Library is huge (People, Animals, Vehicles, Furniture 39, Props 86, Environments 55, Primitives) in a 2-column tile grid. Filed new-entry proposal scene-editor-3d since no codebook entry covers 3D scene authoring."
